  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "AIDev",
  "description": "\n  \n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tAIDev: Studying AI Coding Agents on GitHub (The Rise of AI Teammates in Software Engineering 3.0)\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPapers:\nThe Rise of AI Teammates in Software Engineering (SE) 3.0: How Autonomous Coding Agents Are Reshaping Software Engineering\nAIDev: Studying AI Coding Agents on GitHub\n\n\nGitHub: https://github.com/SAILResearch/AI_Teammates_in_SE3\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\ud83d\udce2 Call for Papers\n\t\n\nWe invite researchers to leverage the AIDev dataset and submit their findings to our upcoming\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/hao-li/AIDev.",
